.target,'width=550px,height=350px');return false">txärem</a></span> [ˈt&#8217;æ.ɾɛm] <em>n.</em> bone<br /><span style="font-weight: bold; margin-left: -0.7em;"><a class="map_excluded" href="https://s.learnnavi.org/audio/vocab/13100.mp3" onclick="window.open(this.href,this.target,'width=550px,height=350px');return false">Txärpawk</a></span> [ˈt&#8217;æɾ.pawk̚] <em>prop.n.</em> Palulukan Bone Horn<br /><span style="font-weight: bold; margin-left: -0.7em;"><a class="map_excluded" href="https://s.learnnavi.org/audio/vocab/7528.mp3" onclick="window.open(this.href,this.target,'width=550px,height=350px');return false">txasom</a></span> [ˈt&#8217;a.som] <em>adj.</em> very hot<br /><span style="font-weight: bold; margin-left: -0.7em;"><a class="map_excluded" href="https://s.learnnavi.org/audio/vocab/12971.mp3" onclick="window.open(this.href,this.target,'width=550px,height=350px');return false">txasunu</a></span> [t&#8217;a.ˈs·u.n·u] <em>vin.</em> love greatly, enjoy tremendously<br /><span style="font-weight: bold; margin-left: -0.7em;"><a class="map_excluded" href="https://s.learnnavi.org/audio/vocab/10796.mp3" onclick="window.open(this.href,this.target,'width=550px,height=350px');return false">txatx</a></span> [t&#8217;at&#8217;] <em>n.</em> bubble<br /><span style="font-weight: bold; margin-left: -0.7em;"><a class="map_excluded" href="https://s.learnnavi.org/audio/vocab/12968.mp3" onclick="window.open(this.href,this.target,'width=550px,height=350px');return false">txavä&#8217;</a></span> [t&#8217;a.ˈvæʔ] <em>adj.</em> disgusting<br /><span style="font-weight: bold; margin-left: -0.7em;"><a class="map_excluded" href="https://s.learnnavi.org/audio/vocab/13268.mp3" onclick="window.open(this.href,this.target,'width=550px,height=350px');return false">txaw</a></span> [t&#8217;·aw] <em>vtr.</em> punish<br /><span style="font-weight: bold; margin-left: -0.7em;"><a class="map_excluded" href="https://s.learnnavi.org/audio/vocab/7512.mp3" onclick="window.open(this.href,this.target,